<Layout
  titleOverride="Building Construction Company in Shaheed Path, Lucknow | VP Infra"
  description="Building Construction Company in Shaheed Path, Lucknow by VP Infra. ISO 9001:2015 certified residential, commercial and turnkey construction. Get a quote today."
>
  {schemas.map((s) => <script type="application/ld+json" set:html={JSON.stringify(s)} />)}
  <section class="page-header text-center" style="background-image: linear-gradient(rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.8), rgba(10, 25, 47, 0.8)), url('/images/locations/township-villas-construction-lucknow.webp');">
  <div class="container"><h1 class="fade-in-up">Building Construction Company in Shaheed Path, Lucknow</h1><p class="fade-in-up mt-4">Villas, apartment buildings, farmhouses and homes along Shaheed Path, planned for open plots and developing infrastructure.</p></div>
  </section>

  <section class="service-details" data-words="main">
  <div class="container"><div class="grid gap-8 service-grid">
  <div class="service-content fade-in-up">
  <h2 class="section-title" style="text-align: left; margin-bottom: 2rem;">Construction Along the Shaheed Path Corridor</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 snapshot" data-snap="1">VP Infra is a building construction company on Shaheed Path, Lucknow, that builds villas, apartments, independent houses and farmhouses on open plots. We handle site preparation, utilities coordination and construction under ISO 9001:2015 procedures, so projects in developing areas progress without constant firefighting.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">Shaheed Path runs along the southern edge of the city and has opened up large tracts for housing. Open plots feel like freedom. Then you discover there is no sewer line, the electricity connection is two months away and the access road turns to mud after rain. Experience with projects in developing areas lets us anticipate these things before they cost you time.</p>
  <div class="mt-8"><a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary">Start Your Project</a></div>
  </div>
  <div class="service-image fade-in-up" style="animation-delay: 0.2s;"><img src="/images/locations/township-villas-construction-lucknow.webp" alt="Building construction company on Shaheed Path, Lucknow: villas and homes under construction in a gated community" width="1024" height="1024" loading="eager"></div>
  </div></div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt-section" data-words="main">
  <div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">What We Build in Shaheed Path</h2>
  <div class="loc-intro"><p class="snapshot" style="text-align:left" data-snap="1">Our building construction services in Shaheed Path, Lucknow, cover houses, rental floors, commercial buildings and turnkey projects. Each service below comes with one written scope, one schedule and one team, so you know what is being built, by when and at what cost.</p></div>
  <div class="grid gap-8 build-grid">
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Villas and Farmhouses</h3><p class="card-text">Larger homes with gardens, garages and outdoor spaces planned on bigger plots.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Apartment Buildings</h3><p class="card-text">Multi-storey blocks with lift cores, stilt parking and independent flats on larger plots.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Independent Houses</h3><p class="card-text">Family homes on standard plots, with parking, a terrace and room for future floors.</p></div></div>
  <div class="card fade-in-up"><div class="card-content"><h3 class="card-title">Site Development</h3><p class="card-text">Levelling, boundary walls, internal roads and drainage before the main building.</p></div></div>
  </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section data-words="main">
  <div class="container loc-text">
  <h2 class="section-title">Planning for Developing Areas on Shaheed Path</h2>
  <p class="mb-4 snapshot" data-snap="1">On Shaheed Path, infrastructure often arrives after the buildings do. Water supply, drainage, power connections and paved access roads may all be missing at the start, so a construction plan must include temporary arrangements and realistic timelines for permanent ones.</p>
  <p class="mb-4">We arrange borewells or tanker supply for construction water, temporary power from generators when needed, and gravel or paved access for material trucks. Large open plots can be low-lying, so we study levels and plan drainage so monsoon runoff doesn't collect against your foundation. Boundary walls go up early, which protects material from theft and clearly marks your plot. These details seem minor, and they decide whether a project runs on time.</p>
  <div class="nearby"><p>We also build in nearby areas:</p><div class="area-links"><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sushant-golf-city-lucknow/">Building Construction in Sushant Golf City</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sultanpur-road-lucknow/">Building Construction in Sultanpur Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-vrindavan-yojana-lucknow/">Building Construction in Vrindavan Yojana</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-kanpur-road-lucknow/">Building Construction in Kanpur Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-lucknow/">Building Construction Company in Lucknow</a></div></div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section class="alt-section" data-words="main">
  <div class="container">
  <h2 class="section-title">Frequently Asked Questions</h2>
  <div class="faq-list">
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Which building construction company works on Shaheed Path, Lucknow?</h3><p>V.P. Infra Properties (OPC) Private Limited builds villas, apartments, houses and farmhouses along Shaheed Path. It is ISO 9001:2015 certified and registered under MSME Udyam. Call 8840069902 to arrange a plot visit and receive a written estimate. Open plots differ, so every estimate follows a visit.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Do you handle water and power arrangements for construction on open plots?</h3><p>Yes. We arrange construction water through borewells or tankers and use generators until permanent connections arrive. We also help you apply for permanent connections early, since utility approvals can take longer than the structure itself and hold up your handover.</p></div>
  <div class="faq-item"><h3>Can you build a villa or farmhouse on Shaheed Path?</h3><p>Yes. Larger plots here suit villas and farmhouses with gardens, garages and terraces. We plan the layout around your family, check coverage and height limits for sanction and design the structure for the final number of floors, so extra floors can be added later without strengthening.</p></div>
  </div>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section class="cta-banner" data-words="main">
  <div class="container">
  <h2>Plan Your Shaheed Path Building With VP Infra</h2>
  <p>Tell us your plot size and what you want to build. We will visit, assess the site and send a written estimate.</p>
  <a href="/contact-us" class="btn btn-primary">Get a Quote</a>
  <p class="phone">Call or WhatsApp 8840069902</p>
  </div>
  </section>

  <section>
  <div class="container text-center">
  <h2 class="section-title" style="font-size:1.8rem">Other Areas We Serve in Lucknow</h2>
  <div class="area-links"><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-gomti-nagar-lucknow/">Gomti Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-gomti-nagar-extension-lucknow/">Gomti Nagar Extension</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-hazratganj-lucknow/">Hazratganj</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-aliganj-lucknow/">Aliganj</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-indira-nagar-lucknow/">Indira Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-mahanagar-lucknow/">Mahanagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-jankipuram-lucknow/">Jankipuram</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-ashiyana-lucknow/">Ashiyana</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-alambagh-lucknow/">Alambagh</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-rajajipuram-lucknow/">Rajajipuram</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-chinhat-lucknow/">Chinhat</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-faizabad-road-lucknow/">Faizabad Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sultanpur-road-lucknow/">Sultanpur Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-kanpur-road-lucknow/">Kanpur Road</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-vrindavan-yojana-lucknow/">Vrindavan Yojana</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sushant-golf-city-lucknow/">Sushant Golf City</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-krishna-nagar-lucknow/">Krishna Nagar</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-amausi-lucknow/">Amausi</a><a href="/services/building-construction-company-in-sitapur-road-lucknow/">Sitapur Road</a></div>
  </div>
  </section>
</Layout>

